-- input.md --
Backslash does not escape a quote: <gno-icon name="star" label="a\"b" />

Spaced slash: <gno-icon name="star" / >

Unquoted value eats the slash: <gno-icon name=star/>

Tabs between attributes: <gno-icon	name="star"	label="t"	/>

	<gno-icon name="star" /> tab-indented is code
-- output.html --
<p>Backslash does not escape a quote: <svg class="gno-icon" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" role="img" aria-label="a\"><path d="m7.5 11.5-5 3 2-5.131-4-3.869h5l2-5 2 5h5l-4 4 2 5z" transform="translate(3 3)"/></svg></p>
<p>Spaced slash: <!-- gno-icon: write it self-closing, <gno-icon name="…" /> --></p>
<p>Unquoted value eats the slash: <!-- gno-icon: write it self-closing, <gno-icon name="…" /> --></p>
<p>Tabs between attributes: <svg class="gno-icon" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" role="img" aria-label="t"><path d="m7.5 11.5-5 3 2-5.131-4-3.869h5l2-5 2 5h5l-4 4 2 5z" transform="translate(3 3)"/></svg></p>
<pre><code>&lt;gno-icon name=&quot;star&quot; /&gt; tab-indented is code
</code></pre>
